abstract: >-
  Audited code-only methods for GBM posterior volatility estimation, Gaussian
  marginal quadrature, and arithmetic Asian option pricing, with an independent
  synthetic posterior-integration comparison. Licensed market observations and
  manuscript-scale numerical results are not included in this pre-release.
